          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T07:34:22.374922+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Сде­ла­ем за­ме­ну <span data-inline-latex=\"y=\\log_{(x^{2}+1)} (x-3)^{2}\"></span> . Тогда дан­ное не­ра­вен­ство при­ни­ма­ет вид</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"y(y-3)\\le -2\\iff (y-1)(y-2)\\le 0\\iff 1\\le y\\le 2\"></span>.</p></center><p>Сде­ла­ем об­рат­ную за­ме­ну: <span data-inline-latex=\"1\\le \\log_{(x^{2}+1)} (x-3)^{2}\\le 2\"></span>. По­сколь­ку при всех <span data-inline-latex=\"x\\ne 0\"></span> спра­вед­ли­во не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"x^{2}+1\\gt 1\"></span>, по­лу­ча­ем си­сте­му</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"x^{2}+1\\le (x-3)^{2}\\le (x^{2}+1)^{2}\"></span> ,</p></center><p>рав­но­силь­ную дан­но­му не­ра­вен­ству, по­сколь­ку число 0 не яв­ля­ет­ся её ре­ше­ни­ем.</p><p>Решим по­лу­чен­ную си­сте­му:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}x^{2}+1\\le (x-3)^{2}\\\\(x-3)^{2}\\le (x^{2}+1)^{2}\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x^{2}+1-x^{2}+6x-9\\le 0\\\\(x-3+x^{2}+1)(x-3-x^{2}-1)\\le 0\\end{cases}\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\begin{cases}6x-8\\le 0\\\\(x^{2}+x-2)(-x^{2}+x-4)\\le 0\\end{cases}\\iff \\begin{cases}x\\le \\frac{4}{3}\\\\(x^{2}+x-2)(x^{2}-x+4)\\ge 0\\end{cases}\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\begin{cases}x\\le \\frac{4}{3}\\\\\\left[\\begin{aligned}x\\ge 1\\\\x\\le -2\\end{aligned}\\right.\\end{cases}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}1\\le x\\le \\frac{4}{3}\\\\x\\le -2\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> </p><p></p><p></p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
