              "html": "<p>Пусть  <span data-inline-latex=\"t=5^{\\frac{x}{x+3}}\"></span> ,  тогда</p><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"5^{\\frac{2x}{x+3}}=t^{2}\"></span> , <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"5^{\\frac{2x+3}{x+3}}=5^{\\frac{x+x+3}{x+3}}=5^{1+\\frac{x}{x+3}}=5t\"></span>. </p><p></p><p> Имеем:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}-5t\\ge t-5\\iff t^{2}-6t+5\\ge 0\\iff (t-1)(t-5)\\ge 0\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}t\\le 1\\\\t\\ge 5\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p></center><p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"f2591c91-777b-4a47-991a-72a21f890d89\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>Вер­нем­ся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}5^{\\frac{x}{x+3}}\\le 1\\\\5^{\\frac{x}{x+3}}\\ge 5\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}5^{\\frac{x}{x+3}}\\le 5^{0}\\\\5^{\\frac{x}{x+3}}\\ge 5^{1}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x}{x+3}\\le 0\\\\\\frac{x}{x+3}\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x}{x+3}\\le 0\\\\\\frac{-3}{x+3}\\ge 0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}-3\\lt x\\le 0\\\\x\\lt -3\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </span></p></center>",
